<title>POLAND: KPW clears Budimex issue for take-over.</title>
<headline>KPW clears Budimex issue for take-over.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared on Thursday for public trade two million preferred shares of the construction company Budimex SA to be exchanged for shares of trader Budimex Trading SA.</p>
<p>One Budimex SA share will be exchanged for two Budimex Trading SA shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The take-over of Budimex Trading SA by Budimex SA will complete the privatisation process of Budimex SA of which Budimex Trading was carved out, as well as the economic growth of Budimex SA,&quot; the KPW wrote in a note on the approval.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
